  "body": "Sneak Peek Open Home this weekend ! \r\nNearly complete and ready to impress, this brand-new home is your opportunity to secure a high-quality residence in one of Millwater's final and most sought-after neighbourhoods. Thoughtfully designed with versatility in mind, this exceptional home offers a flexible layout ideal for growing families, multi-generational living, or those wanting additional space to work from home.\r\n\r\nYou'll love:\r\n* Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas designed for effortless everyday living and entertaining\r\n* A stylish designer kitchen featuring quality appliances, generous bench space and contemporary finishes\r\n* Five spacious bedrooms, including a private master suite complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* A versatile wing featuring two bedrooms, a bathroom and a separate living area-perfect for extended family, guests, teenagers or a work-from-home setup\r\n* Two separate outdoor entertaining areas, providing the perfect spaces for summer BBQs, family gatherings or quiet relaxation\r\n* Beautifully appointed bathrooms with modern fixtures and fittings\r\n* Ducted air conditioning throughout for year-round comfort\r\n* Low-maintenance landscaping designed for easy living\r\n* Internal access garaging plus excellent storage throughout\r\n* Brand new construction with completion just around the corner\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of the final stages of Millwater, you'll enjoy the convenience of nearby schools, parks, walkways, shopping, cafés and easy motorway access, all within a thriving and established community.\r\n\r\nWith completion fast approaching, now is the time to secure this stunning new home before someone else does. Move in sooner than you think and enjoy all the benefits of a brand-new home without the wait and before prices increase. \r\n\r\nContact Sarah today by email or phone/text on 021 919 459 to arrange an inspection or for more information.",
